stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "Draft, add-back re-run on every save" as DRAFT
    state "Pending approval" as PENDING
    state "Approved" as APPROVED
    state "Issued to the candidate" as ISSUED
    state "Accepted" as ACCEPTED
    state "Declined by the candidate" as DECLINED
    state "Expired" as EXPIRED
    state "Rescinded by the employer" as RESCINDED
    state "Superseded by a revision" as SUPERSEDED
    state "Joined, handed to onboarding" as JOINED
    state "Not joined" as NOT_JOINED

    [*] --> DRAFT: O1 created when the application reaches the offer stage
    DRAFT --> PENDING: O3 submitted, add-back evaluated, fixed point converged
    PENDING --> DRAFT: O5 returned, or a rule version it used is superseded
    PENDING --> APPROVED: O4 last approver approves, approver is not the maker
    APPROVED --> DRAFT: O13 a rule version it used is superseded before issue
    APPROVED --> ISSUED: O6 letter rendered, bound figures match the engine
    ISSUED --> ACCEPTED: O7 candidate accepts the current version
    ISSUED --> DECLINED: O8 candidate declines
    ISSUED --> EXPIRED: O9 validity date passes
    ISSUED --> RESCINDED: O11 employer rescinds, confirmer rule applies
    ISSUED --> SUPERSEDED: O10 revised, a new version starts in draft
    APPROVED --> SUPERSEDED: O10 revised before issue
    ACCEPTED --> JOINED: O12 onboarding register commit
    ACCEPTED --> NOT_JOINED: O12n candidate does not join, requisition reopens
    JOINED --> [*]
    DECLINED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    RESCINDED --> [*]
    NOT_JOINED --> [*]
    SUPERSEDED --> [*]
